STORE INFORMATION SHOWN WITH THE QUESTION:
[1] Store FAQ (Buying and paying). Are prices inclusive of GST? Yes. The MRP on the tag and on the kiosk includes 18% GST. The invoice shows the GST amount separately.

[2] Store FAQ (Buying and paying). Can I be told when an out-of-stock watch arrives? Yes. Staff can register your number and you get an SMS when the watch reaches this store.

[3] Store FAQ (Warranty and service). Can I claim warranty at another Veyra store? Yes, at any Veyra brand store in India, with the invoice.

