STORE INFORMATION SHOWN WITH THE QUESTION:
[1] Store FAQ (Buying and paying). Can a gift card be used with a festive offer? Yes, a gift card is a payment method, so it can be used with any current offer.

[2] Offer PR-FEST10: Festive 10% off. Status: running now (from 2026-10-01 to 2026-11-15). Applies to sub-brand Veyra. Can be combined with other offers: no. Valid on full-price Veyra watches with MRP of Rs. 4,999 or more; maximum discount Rs. 1,500.

[3] Store FAQ (Buying and paying). Do you sell gift cards? Yes. Veyra gift cards from Rs. 500 to Rs. 25,000, valid for 12 months, usable at any Veyra brand store.

